        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Teams: 2003 Hawaii Warriors football team, Houston Cougars, Hamilton Tiger-Cats\n- People: June Jones\n- Organizations: University of Hawaii at Manoa, Canadian Football League\n- Events: 2003 NCAA Division I-A football season, 2003 Sheraton Hawaii Bowl\n\nFacts:\n- June Jones was born on February 19, 1953.\n- June Jones is an American football coach and former player.\n- June Jones served as head coach of the 2003 Hawaii Warriors football team and later served as head coach of the Hamilton Tiger-Cats in the Canadian Football League.\n- The 2003 Hawaii Warriors football team represented the University of Hawaii at Manoa in the 2003 NCAA Division I-A football season.\n- The 2003 Hawaii Warriors football team completed its second straight winning season and its fourth winning season in five years under June Jones.\n- The 2003 Hawaii Warriors football team finished its season with a bowl win.\n- The 2003 Sheraton Hawaii Bowl matched the hometown Hawaii Warriors against the Houston Cougars.",
